        "testimonials": {
          "enabled": true,
          "data": {
            "title": "What Our Clients Say",
            "subtitle": "Real reviews from Green Light Realty clients.",
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Noelle was wonderful to work with. She is extremely knowledgeable, patient, and thorough. She got to know me as a client, her customer service is more than exceptional. She is very responsive, always on top of things, and even ahead of the lawyers and inspectors, she is on your side. She even reminded me of all the things I needed to do before moving in, insurances, utilities etc. She is honest and dependable and made the whole process stress free and enjoyable. Thank you for finding me my dream retirement home!",
                "reviewer": "Kim Lowery",
                "rating": 5,
                "source": "Verified Client"
              },
              {
                "text": "Noelle helped us with our dream home and was very knowledgeable and responsive through out the entire process. Navigating the current market was tough but she helped us get through it. Even after we closed she was always available to answer all our questions and help us out",
                "reviewer": "hillbe340",
                "rating": 5,
                "source": "Verified Client"
              },
              {
                "text": "Couldn't be happier to have Noelle as my agent. Thank God she's patient and made it happen. I know I would've given up if I was her, glad she didn't. Noelle made it happen!!!",
                "reviewer": "eszymborski",
                "rating": 5,
                "source": "Verified Client"
              },
              {
                "text": "Noelle was wonderful to work with. She helped my fiancé and I buy our first house. She made the experience easy and enjoyable for first time home buyers like us. Noelle was incredibly helpful throughout the entire process and quick to respond to our many questions: from getting us all of the information on houses we were interested in touring, to recommending a great pizza place by our new home! She was also able to refer us to our lawyer, mortgage broker, and house inspector, all of whom were very professional and great to work with. We are so thankful for hard work and definitely recommend her!",
                "reviewer": "Alex Nizzardo",
                "rating": 5,
                "source": "Verified Client"
              },
              {
                "text": "Noelle was a great agent. She walked us through the entire process and pointed out many important key elements to make this transaction a breeze. We will use her services again and again.",
                "reviewer": "JUAN FIGUEROA",
                "rating": 5,
                "source": "Verified Client"
              },
              {
                "text": "We can't speak highly enough of our experience with Noelle DiBenedetto. We were searching for our forever home in the midst of an aggressive, competitive housing market. Noelle is honest, hands-on, and always answered every call, text or email no matter what time of day or night it was. She utilizes her relationships and expert knowledge of the market to ensure her clients present as the strongest buyers. When we finally found the “one” and ended up in a bidding war, Noelle walked us through every step of the negotiations, even suggesting that we write a letter to the sellers to explain why we thought they should choose us. It was an unconventional approach but it worked and we thank Noelle for that every day! In short, she was always on our side working to make our house purchase (and sale) as simple and successful as possible. We would recommend Noelle to anyone.",
                "reviewer": "Daniel Aguarda",
                "rating": 5,
                "source": "Verified Client"
